## [v0.7.0 – Invite-Only Signup & Email Integration]
**Date:** 2025-12-22

### Changes Made:
- Integrated Resend email service for transactional emails (invite sending)
- Implemented invite-only signup mode via `REQUIRE_INVITE` environment variable
- Created admin bootstrap system that auto-sends invite to `ADMIN_EMAIL` on fresh deployment
- Built `/invites` admin page with email input, send button, and invitation management table
- Added invitation status tracking: Pending (yellow), Account Created (green), Expired (red)
- Created AdminNav component with pill-style navigation between Metrics and Invites pages
- Reused header-nav styling patterns for consistent admin navigation UI
- Hidden signup links from login page and header (invite-only access)
- Made `InvitedByID` nullable in Invitation model for system-generated invites
- Secured docker-compose.yml with environment variable references (`${VAR_NAME}`)
- Added `.env` to `.gitignore` for local secrets management
- Updated DATABASE_URL to use `${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}` variable

### Files Created:
- `backend/internal/email/email.go` - Resend email service wrapper with fallback logging
- `backend/internal/database/bootstrap.go` - Admin invite bootstrap on startup
- `frontend/src/services/invitesApi.ts` - Frontend API client for invitations
- `frontend/src/app/invites/page.tsx` - Admin invitations management page
- `frontend/src/app/invites/invites.css` - Invites page styles
- `frontend/src/components/AdminNav/AdminNav.tsx` - Admin navigation component
- `frontend/src/components/AdminNav/AdminNav.css` - Admin nav styles

### Files Modified:
- `backend/internal/models/invitation.go` - Made InvitedByID nullable (*uint)
- `backend/internal/auth/tokens.go` - Updated CreateInvitationToken to accept *uint
- `backend/internal/handlers/invitations.go` - Added email sending on invite creation
- `backend/internal/handlers/auth.go` - Added ADMIN_EMAIL auto-promote check
- `backend/cmd/server/main.go` - Added email init and bootstrap call
- `frontend/src/app/metrics/page.tsx` - Added AdminNav component
- `frontend/src/app/login/page.tsx` - Removed signup link
- `frontend/src/components/header/Header.tsx` - Removed signup link, kept login only
- `docker-compose.yml` - Secured with env var references, added email config

### Current Status:
All features working. Docker deployment fully functional with PostgreSQL, backend, and frontend containers. Email invites sent successfully via Resend. Admin bootstrap creates first invite on fresh deploy. Secrets secured via .env file (gitignored). Admin can send invites from /invites page and track their status.

